\title{Category Madness}
\taxon{Root}
\meta{layer}{human}
\meta{revision}{1}
\tag{index}

\p{Category Madness is a Lean 4 research library whose candidate common primitive is a reduced augmented virtual double ∞-category (\ref{dec-rt-0016}). The design now treats that root as provisional until the foundation-feasibility evidence passes. Public mathematics targets the bundled specification seal in \ref{dec-rt-0028} and the interface policy in \ref{dec-ch-0014}.}

\p{This forest is the active human and machine index under \ref{dec-wf-0008} and \ref{dec-wf-0009}. Design revision 1 is recorded in \ref{wf-0002}; superseded nodes remain available for exact lookup but are excluded from normal work and rejected as active citations.}

